173
00:08:51.288 --> 00:08:57.539
Mode, and Commit returns when..., and RPO on leader loss, and Write latency, and Availability risk.

174
00:08:57.819 --> 00:08:58.843
Asynchronous.

175
00:08:59.123 --> 00:09:00.424
Commit returns when...:

176
00:09:00.704 --> 00:09:03.029
Leader has flushed WAL locally.

177
00:09:03.309 --> 00:09:04.867
RPO on leader loss:

178
00:09:05.147 --> 00:09:08.368
Up to the replication lag (seconds; more under load).

179
00:09:08.648 --> 00:09:09.715
Write latency:

180
00:09:09.995 --> 00:09:10.805
Lowest.

181
00:09:11.085 --> 00:09:12.365
Availability risk:

182
00:09:12.645 --> 00:09:13.925
None from replicas.

183
00:09:14.205 --> 00:09:16.915
Semi-synchronous or quorum sync (ANY k (...)).

184
00:09:17.195 --> 00:09:21.355
Commit returns when...: k of the listed standbys have the WAL.

185
00:09:21.635 --> 00:09:23.192
RPO on leader loss:

186
00:09:23.472 --> 00:09:26.416
0, if you fail over to a standby in the quorum.

187
00:09:26.696 --> 00:09:30.877
Write latency: + 1 network round trip to the nearest k standbys.

188
00:09:31.157 --> 00:09:32.437
