529
00:29:55.539 --> 00:29:56.947
Context and Problem.

530
00:29:57.227 --> 00:30:00.577
An async failover lost ~4 s of committed writes:

531
00:30:00.857 --> 00:30:04.633
38 captured payments had no order (§1.1).

532
00:30:04.913 --> 00:30:10.609
Replica reads showed customers stale order states, and time went backwards across refreshes.

533
00:30:10.889 --> 00:30:11.593
2.

534
00:30:11.873 --> 00:30:13.217
Goals or Non-Goals.

535
00:30:13.497 --> 00:30:14.329
Goals:

536
00:30:14.609 --> 00:30:27.857
RPO = 0 for payments, orders and the ledger; RTO at most 60 s; no split brain; read-your-writes and monotonic reads on replica reads; low-value writes don't pay sync latency.

537
00:30:28.137 --> 00:30:36.542
Non-goals: multi-region active-active writes (Ch 27); logical replication for CDC (Ch 13).

538
00:30:37.892 --> 00:30:38.639
