542
00:30:44.605 --> 00:30:45.650
NFR-1:

543
00:30:45.930 --> 00:30:52.543
No acknowledged commit of a money-class transaction may be lost on the failure of any single node or AZ.

544
00:30:52.823 --> 00:30:53.869
NFR-2:

545
00:30:54.149 --> 00:30:56.623
Writes stay available with one standby down.

546
00:30:56.903 --> 00:31:05.031
NFR-3: p99 commit latency for money-class transactions at most 15 ms (same region, cross-AZ).

547
00:31:05.311 --> 00:31:06.399
NFR-4:

548
00:31:06.679 --> 00:31:11.287
A partitioned primary stops accepting writes before any standby is promoted.

549
00:31:11.567 --> 00:31:12.613
NFR-5:

550
00:31:12.893 --> 00:31:18.418
After any failover, a reconciliation against the payment provider completes within 30 min.

551
00:31:18.698 --> 00:31:19.786
NFR-6:

552
00:31:20.066 --> 00:31:24.162
Replica reads honour read-your-writes and monotonic reads per session.

553
00:31:25.512 --> 00:31:26.216
