561
00:31:51.563 --> 00:31:55.595
Added commit latency (quorum of 1 of 2 cross-AZ standbys).

562
00:31:55.875 --> 00:31:56.942
Calculation:

563
00:31:57.222 --> 00:32:05.265
Cross-AZ RTT ~0.5 to 2 ms + standby fsync ~0.5 to 1 ms.

564
00:32:05.545 --> 00:32:07.955
Result: +1 to 3 ms per commit.

565
00:32:08.235 --> 00:32:09.430
