00:34:53.801 --> 00:34:55.807
Quorum ANY 1 (r1, r2).

615
00:34:56.087 --> 00:34:56.940
Pros:

616
00:34:57.220 --> 00:35:01.209
RPO 0 with one standby down; +1 to 3 ms.

617
00:35:01.489 --> 00:35:02.300
Cons:

618
00:35:02.580 --> 00:35:15.465
Two standbys down, then writes block (alerted; synchronousmodestrict: false lets Patroni fall back to async after a timeout, trading RPO for availability, so this is a Finance-approved decision).

619
00:35:15.745 --> 00:35:16.556
Verdict:

620
00:35:16.836 --> 00:35:17.668
Chosen.

621
00:35:19.018 --> 00:35:22.453
Distributed SQL (CockroachDB or Yugabyte).

