00:35:59.723 --> 00:36:00.875
Failure modes.

637
00:36:01.155 --> 00:36:03.971
One standby down: writes continue (quorum).

638
00:36:04.251 --> 00:36:14.149
Both standbys down: commits block, pages fire, and after 30 s Patroni (non-strict) drops to async and records the RPO exposure window.

639
00:36:14.429 --> 00:36:18.568
Primary partitioned: self-fence and promote (§3.3).

640
00:36:18.848 --> 00:36:21.195
