644
00:36:31.979 --> 00:36:51.840
Replication lag per standby (bytes and seconds), syncstate, waitevent = 'SyncRep' count, commit latency percentiles, replication slot retained WAL, timeline ID changes (failover events), Patroni leader changes, watchdog status, and reconciliation findings per failover.

645
00:36:53.190 --> 00:36:54.043
14.

646
00:36:54.323 --> 00:36:58.654
Decision (ADR-038 or 039 summary).

647
00:36:58.934 --> 00:37:08.406
Money-class data uses single-leader PostgreSQL with quorum synchronous replication across AZs and per-transaction durability levels.

648
00:37:08.686 --> 00:37:18.094
Failover is Patroni-managed with a DCS lease, self-demotion and a mandatory watchdog, with writes only through the managed writer endpoint.

649
00:37:18.374 --> 00:37:24.731
Every failover triggers rewind of all diverged nodes and a reconciliation against the payment provider.

