01:07:25.723 --> 01:07:29.542
Guidance: remoteapply only where replica read-your-writes is needed.

1079
01:07:29.822 --> 01:07:32.745
Patroni ttl or loopwait or retrytimeout.

1080
01:07:33.025 --> 01:07:34.091
Starting point:

1081
01:07:34.371 --> 01:07:35.865
30 or 10 or 10.

1082
01:07:36.145 --> 01:07:37.041
Guidance:

1083
01:07:37.321 --> 01:07:47.838
Satisfy ttl ≥ loopwait + 2 times retrytimeout; shorter = faster RTO, more false failovers. maximumlagonfailover.

1084
01:07:48.118 --> 01:07:49.185
Starting point:

1085
01:07:49.465 --> 01:07:50.425
