1087
01:07:51.881 --> 01:07:56.019
Don't promote lagging nodes. walkeepsize or WAL archive.

1088
01:07:56.299 --> 01:07:57.366
Starting point:

1089
01:07:57.646 --> 01:08:01.166
Enough for rewind after the longest partition you tolerate.

1090
01:08:01.446 --> 01:08:02.342
Guidance:

1091
01:08:02.622 --> 01:08:04.179
Required for pgrewind.

1092
01:08:05.529 --> 01:08:06.937
maxslotwalkeepsize.

1093
01:08:07.217 --> 01:08:08.284
Starting point:

1094
01:08:08.564 --> 01:08:09.972
10 to 50 GB.

1095
01:08:10.252 --> 01:08:11.148
Guidance:

1096
01:08:11.428 --> 01:08:14.415
Protects the primary's disk. hotstandbyfeedback.

1097
01:08:14.695 --> 01:08:15.761
Starting point:

1098
01:08:16.041 --> 01:08:20.265
Off on OLTP read replicas (on for a dedicated reporting replica).

