01:08:26.825 --> 01:08:27.892
Starting point:

1103
01:08:28.172 --> 01:08:29.367
16 MB.

1104
01:08:29.647 --> 01:08:30.543
Guidance:

1105
01:08:30.823 --> 01:08:33.212
Beyond it, no one reads from that replica.

1106
01:08:33.492 --> 01:08:35.241
Cassandra RF or CL.

