Quorum sync standbys across AZs + fenced failover.

1328
01:23:55.663 --> 01:23:57.669
Fast writes for recoverable data:

1329
01:23:57.949 --> 01:24:00.765
SET LOCAL synchronouscommit = local.

1330
01:24:01.045 --> 01:24:02.773
Fresh reads after own writes:

1331
01:24:03.053 --> 01:24:07.149
