1336
01:24:16.890 --> 01:24:18.405
Offline device edits:

1337
01:24:18.685 --> 01:24:22.375
Domain precedence or CRDTs + idempotency keys.

1338
01:24:22.655 --> 01:24:23.701
Region loss:

1339
01:24:23.981 --> 01:24:30.082
Async DR with explicit RPO, or consensus DB if RPO 0 is required.

